AyuGram for iOS
===============

This is a native iOS port of AyuGram for Android (AyuGram4A).
It is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (see LICENSE).

Original works and authors
--------------------------

* AyuGram4A — https://github.com/AyuGram/AyuGram4A
  Copyright (C) 2023 Radolyn and AyuGram contributors.
  "We do not and cannot prevent the use of our code, but be respectful and credit the original author."
  The AyuGram-specific logic of this port (ghost mode, message saving, edits history,
  message filters, AyuSync, preference keys and defaults, strings) is a translation of
  the Java sources in TMessagesProj/src/main/java/com/radolyn/ayugram. Files derived from
  a specific Android source name it in their header comment.

* exteraGram — https://github.com/exteraSquad/exteraGram (GPL-2.0)
* Telegraher — https://github.com/nikitasius/Telegraher (GPL-2.0)
* Telegram for Android — https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram
  Copyright (C) Nikolai Kudashov and Telegram contributors. Licensed under GNU GPL v. 2 or later.

The iOS port does not contain code from those projects' Java/C++ sources verbatim; it
re-implements their behaviour in Swift on top of TDLib.

